title: "ai-science-toolkit"
abstract: >-
  A toolkit for AI-assisted scientific computing: Claude Code skills,
  domain-expert reviewer agents (climate attribution, statistics, meteorology,
  science communication), and shell utilities for scientific research workflows.
type: software
authors:
